    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the adventure game Vera Jones: The Legend of the Seven Relics on PC, guide the heroine Vera Jones, a champion climber, to find a mysterious artifact. Explore nine levels to get your hands on the coveted relic before your enemies, a sinister secret society, find it first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the young adventurer Vera Jones and uncover the mysteries of an ancient civilization whose legacy threatens the entire human race.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take part in a unique game that offers not only a captivating adventure, but also a realistic climbing simulation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover innovative gameplay thanks to a special engine that allows you to control each of the adventurer's limbs independently.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a rich game experience that includes exploration, shooting, infiltration, platforming, and various puzzles to solve.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a variety of environments (tombs, caves, labyrinths) created by an ancient civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face different enemies in hand-to-hand combat or with your weapons (Beretta, Ingram, USP, AK 47).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress at your own pace: dare to engage in direct combat or use your climbing skills to move stealthily.</p></li></ul>",
